
=== Buddy 5 profile bench v0.7.1 (rule B; sweep -550..+440 dd) (wheels never driven) ===
  a  auto: guard/confirm below 150 mm, then scan + plan (any key leaves)
  s  one scan + plan now          p  one ping straight ahead (class, width, rise latency)
  c  centre servo                 , .  servo centre trim -/+5 us (now 1450 us)
  m  settle time 40 <-> 80 ms (now 40 ms)
  w  fall wait 100 <-> 250 ms (now 100 ms; 250 = diagnostic only, to measure the no-target pulse)
  i  inject for the NEXT scan only: stuck-high -> no-rise -> off (now off)
  [ / ]  hold at the LEFT / RIGHT end of the sweep (check frame clearance)
  1 / 5 / 3  auto stop distance 110 / 150 / 150 mm (now 150 mm; bench only)
  h  this help
Angles: - = left, + = right. Gap test = car 155 + 2 x 50 mm; footprint check uses pivot-to-front 150 mm (ASSUMED).
